      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْشُوشٌ</span></b>  [<i>Sprinkled,</i> or <i>scattered in drops;</i>
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَشِيشٌ</span></b> , occurring in this sense in a verse
in the TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خفت</span>]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَلٌّ مَرْشُوشٌ</span> [<i>A
